{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】高空反氣旋正為廣東帶來大致良好的天氣。本港地區今日(10月30日)天氣預測，天晴。日間乾燥，市區最高氣溫約30度，新界再高一兩度。吹輕微至和緩偏東風。</p>\n<p>展望明日日間大致天晴及乾燥。星期日雲量增多。隨後一兩日部分時間有陽光。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T23:20:45.232237+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T23:04:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T23:18:24.617799+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T23:18:24.617799+00:00","content_hash":"b95f296f359e93225c9a2f5596842d68905766441b8f5e8b2206db3d3bb13053","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}